Cell["\<\
The segment between the centre of a grid and a vertex two steps up and two \
across, drawn by its densities: six geodesics of length 4, and four of them \
pass the vertex in the middle.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e8a4575e-323f-494d-b136-e0858444e251"],

